<title>PERU: Earthquake drill to halt activities in Peru.</title>
<headline>Earthquake drill to halt activities in Peru.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A nationwide earthquake drill at 1100 local time/1600 GMT will halt activities in Peru for about 15 minutes.</p>
<p>Telephone and electricity services will be cut, and banks and financial markets will briefly suspend services.</p>
<p>Most of Peru's 24 million inhabitants are expected to take part in the drill, organized by the government's Civil Defense body.</p>
<p>-- Lima Newsroom 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
